.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Cegid Primavera V10 - Log\u00edstica<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f5a8d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6f5a8d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>O ERP (Enterprise Resource Planning) permite que uma organiza\u00e7\u00e3o gira eficazmente o seu fluxo de informa\u00e7\u00f5es de forma centralizada, integrando todas as fun\u00e7\u00f5es de neg\u00f3cio numa \u00fanica plataforma de software facilmente acess\u00edvel.<\/p><p>S\u00e3o in\u00fameros os benef\u00edcios da utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o de um sistema ERP em diversos setores e, para a log\u00edstica em particular, o ERP Cegid Primavera V10 revela-se uma ferramenta poderosa na gest\u00e3o do fluxo de dados em tempo real.<\/p><p>O ERP Cegid Primavera V10 potencia significativamente a gest\u00e3o da \u00e1rea log\u00edstica, oferecendo uma s\u00e9rie de funcionalidades avan\u00e7adas.<\/p><p>Esta solu\u00e7\u00e3o permite \u00e0s empresas otimizar as suas opera\u00e7\u00f5es log\u00edsticas, aumentar a efici\u00eancia na gest\u00e3o de stocks e melhorar a tomada de decis\u00f5es com base em dados em tempo real.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e36d96 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7e36d96\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e31553e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e31553e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"631\" height=\"481\" src=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Image-52.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-11557\" alt=\"Software WMS\" srcset=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Image-52.jpg 631w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/Image-52-300x229.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 631px) 100vw, 631px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c643170 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c643170\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&q